{"id":"claim:tam/abilitative-easkay-eaykap--sakhalin-easkay-ability-and-skill","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/abilitative-easkay-eaykap","topics":["topic:tam/abilitative-easkay-eaykap","topic:tam/abilitative-easkay-eaykap--easkay"],"statement":{"en":"In Sakhalin Ainu, the auxiliary verb 'e'askay expresses ability or skill in performing an action.","ja":"樺太アイヌ語において、助動詞 'e'askay は能力や動作が上手であることを表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:sakhalin"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"assertive","conditions":[]},"forms":["'e'askay"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:murasaki2025@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0045-03","stance":"asserts"},{"id":"stmt:murasaki2025@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0049-03","stance":"asserts"},{"id":"stmt:murasaki2025@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0101-09","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/abilitative-easkay-eaykap--sakhalin-eaykah-inherent-inability","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/abilitative-easkay-eaykap","topics":["topic:tam/abilitative-easkay-eaykap","topic:tam/abilitative-easkay-eaykap--inability"],"statement":{"en":"In Sakhalin Ainu, the auxiliary verb 'e'aykah expresses inability due to lack of internal capacity.","ja":"樺太アイヌ語において、助動詞 'e'aykah は能力の欠如による不可能を表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:sakhalin"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"assertive","conditions":[]},"forms":["'e'aykah"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:murasaki2025@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0045-01","stance":"asserts"},{"id":"stmt:murasaki2025@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0049-04","stance":"asserts"},{"id":"stmt:murasaki2025@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0072-04","stance":"asserts"},{"id":"stmt:murasaki2025@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0101-08","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[{"kind":"contrasts","claim":"claim:tam/abilitative-easkay-eaykap--sakhalin-koyaykus-circumstantial-inability","differs_in":null,"note":"Both express inability in Sakhalin Ainu but contrast lack of capacity with circumstantial impediment."}],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/abilitative-easkay-eaykap--sakhalin-koyaykus-circumstantial-inability","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/abilitative-easkay-eaykap","topics":["topic:tam/abilitative-easkay-eaykap","topic:tam/abilitative-easkay-eaykap--inability"],"statement":{"en":"In Sakhalin Ainu, the auxiliary verb koyaykus expresses inability due to external circumstances.","ja":"樺太アイヌ語において、助動詞 koyaykus は周囲の状況による不可能を表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:sakhalin"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"assertive","conditions":[]},"forms":["koyaykus"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:murasaki2025@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0045-02","stance":"asserts"},{"id":"stmt:murasaki2025@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0101-07","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/abilitative-easkay-eaykap--shizunai-askay-aykap-potential-auxiliaries","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/abilitative-easkay-eaykap","topics":["topic:tam/abilitative-easkay-eaykap","topic:tam/abilitative-easkay-eaykap--morphology"],"statement":{"en":"In Shizunai Ainu, the verbs askay and aykap function as auxiliaries denoting possibility and impossibility.","ja":"静内アイヌ語において、動詞 askay および aykap は可能と不可能を表す動詞助動詞として機能する。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"assertive","conditions":[]},"forms":["askay","aykap"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0200-07","stance":"asserts"},{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0201-08","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/abilitative-easkay-eaykap--shizunai-potential-auxiliaries-require-e-prefix","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/abilitative-easkay-eaykap","topics":["topic:tam/abilitative-easkay-eaykap","topic:tam/abilitative-easkay-eaykap--morphology"],"statement":{"en":"In Shizunai Ainu, askay and aykap obligatorily take the prefix e- when functioning as potential auxiliaries.","ja":"静内アイヌ語において、askay と aykap は可能助動詞として機能する際、常に接頭辞 e- を伴う。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"assertive","conditions":["as potential auxiliaries"]},"forms":["askay","aykap","e-","easkay","eaykap"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0200-08","stance":"asserts"},{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0201-09","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[{"kind":"refines","claim":"claim:tam/abilitative-easkay-eaykap--shizunai-askay-aykap-potential-auxiliaries","differs_in":null,"note":"Specifies that askay and aykap always occur with the prefix e- when functioning as auxiliaries."}],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/abilitative-easkay-eaykap--shizunai-ka-interpolation-potential-auxiliary","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/abilitative-easkay-eaykap","topics":["topic:tam/abilitative-easkay-eaykap","topic:tam/abilitative-easkay-eaykap--morphology"],"statement":{"en":"In Shizunai Ainu, the restrictive postposition ka may be interpolated between the verb and the potential auxiliary for emphasis.","ja":"静内アイヌ語において、強調のために動詞と可能助動詞の間に限定の後置詞 ka が挿入されることがある。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"sometimes","modality":"assertive","conditions":["for emphasis"]},"forms":["ka"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0202-01","stance":"asserts"},{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0203-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/abilitative-easkay-eaykap--the-transitive-verb-easkay-functions-as-an-auxiliary","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/abilitative-easkay-eaykap","topics":["topic:tam/abilitative-easkay-eaykap","topic:tam/abilitative-easkay-eaykap--easkay"],"statement":{"en":"The transitive verb easkay functions as an auxiliary expressing potentiality ('can / be able to').","ja":"他動詞 easkay は助動詞として「〜できる」という可能を表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["easkay"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:nakagawa2024@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0312-03","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/abilitative-easkay-eaykap--the-auxiliary-easkay-can-be-skilled-at-is","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/abilitative-easkay-eaykap","topics":["topic:tam/abilitative-easkay-eaykap","topic:tam/abilitative-easkay-eaykap--easkay"],"statement":{"en":"The auxiliary easkay 'can, be skilled at' is also used as an independent verb.","ja":"easkay「〜ができる、〜がうまい」は動詞としても用いられる。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":[],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["easkay"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0097-03","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/abilitative-easkay-eaykap--the-transitive-verb-eaykap-functions-as-an-auxiliary","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/abilitative-easkay-eaykap","topics":["topic:tam/abilitative-easkay-eaykap","topic:tam/abilitative-easkay-eaykap--inability"],"statement":{"en":"The transitive verb eaykap functions as an auxiliary expressing impossibility ('cannot / be unable to') in a broad sense, including lack of ability or circumstantial impediment.","ja":"他動詞 eaykap は助動詞として能力がない場合や状況が許さない場合を含め、広い意味で不可能なこと（「〜できない」）を表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["eaykap"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:nakagawa2024@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0312-04","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/abilitative-easkay-eaykap--the-auxiliary-eaykap-cannot-do-is-also-used","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/abilitative-easkay-eaykap","topics":["topic:tam/abilitative-easkay-eaykap","topic:tam/abilitative-easkay-eaykap--inability"],"statement":{"en":"The auxiliary eaykap 'cannot do' is also used as an independent verb.","ja":"eaykap は動詞としても用いられる。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":[],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["eaykap"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0098-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/abilitative-easkay-eaykap--the-auxiliary-verb-koyayekus-expresses-the-inability-to","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/abilitative-easkay-eaykap","topics":["topic:tam/abilitative-easkay-eaykap","topic:tam/abilitative-easkay-eaykap--inability"],"statement":{"en":"The auxiliary verb koyayekus expresses the inability to endure something or that something is too painful to do.","ja":"助動詞 koyayekus は「苦しくてできない、忍耐・我慢ができない」という意味を表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":[],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["koyayekus"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0100-04","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/abilitative-easkay-eaykap--in-colloquial-ainu-eaykap-is-never-used-as","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/abilitative-easkay-eaykap","topics":["topic:tam/abilitative-easkay-eaykap","topic:tam/abilitative-easkay-eaykap--inability"],"statement":{"en":"In colloquial Ainu, eaykap is never used as an independent verb (*k-eaykap), whereas in literary style, forms such as a-eaykap 'I cannot' are commonly found.","ja":"口語では eaykap が動詞として使われた例は皆無（*k-eaykap）だが、雅語では a-eaykap「私ができない」という例が普通に見られる。"},"type":"variation","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["eaykap","a-eaykap"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0107-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/abilitative-easkay-eaykap--the-auxiliary-verb-eaykap-cannot-occurs-after-the","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/abilitative-easkay-eaykap","topics":["topic:tam/abilitative-easkay-eaykap","topic:tam/abilitative-easkay-eaykap--inability"],"statement":{"en":"The auxiliary verb eaykap 'cannot' occurs after the inflected personal form of the verb, in the same position as somo ki.","ja":"eaykap「できない」は助動詞であるため，somo ki と同様に動詞人称形の後ろに置かれる。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["eaykap"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0141-05","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
